// Frames example. =Name= opens a frame, == closes it.
// Blocks inside a frame have their own "scope": the two "Show error" blocks below are different.
// =Frame= [Block] is a block from another frame, == (Block) is a shared block outside frames.

(Start) -> =Login= [Enter password]

=Login=
[Enter password] -> {Password correct?}
{Password correct?} -> [Show error] "No" -> [Enter password]
{Password correct?} -> =Loading= [Open profile] "Yes"

=Loading=
[Open profile] -> [Load settings] -> {Everything loaded?}
{Everything loaded?} -> [Show error] "No" -> == (End)
{Everything loaded?} -> == (End) "Yes"
